## Model card

- **Name:** Grok Voice Think Fast 2.0
- **Short description:** SpaceXAI's most capable **speech-to-speech voice model** as of July 2026 — the thinking-tier member of the Grok Voice family, succeeding the `grok-voice-think-fast-1.0` line. It is a real-time voice model, not a text model, and belongs in the Voice API product rather than on a text-benchmark ladder.
- **Provider / access:** xAI API — `grok-voice-think-fast-2.0`, region `us-east-1`, under the Voice API product family (Speech to Speech, Text to Speech, Speech to Text, New Custom Voices). It is the current `latest` alias for the whole Grok Voice line.
- **Release / knowledge:** announced 2026-07-31 ("Introducing Grok Voice Think Fast 2.0 — Our most capable speech-to-speech voice model") and listed as available in the July 2026 xAI release notes. **Knowledge cutoff not published.**
- **IDs:** `grok-voice-think-fast-2.0`; alias `grok-voice-latest`. **No OpenCode Zen ID exists** — not in the OpenCode Zen catalog.
- **Context window:** **Not published.** The xAI model page lists no context window and no max-output limit for this model, and no rate-limit figures are given on the page.
- **Modalities:** **Input:** text, audio. **Output:** text, audio — true speech-to-speech. The page states the model family as "Text, Audio → Text, Audio".
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-25):** **No per-model price is published on the model page.** The only verified xAI Voice API price points are the product-level rates in the models index: **Agent $0.08 / min**, **TTS $15.00 / 1M characters**, **STT (batch) $0.10 / hour**, **STT (streaming) $0.20 / hour**. Which of these applies to `grok-voice-think-fast-2.0` specifically is not stated, so no blended $/1M figure can be derived honestly.
- **Architecture:** proprietary; not disclosed. "Think Fast" denotes the reasoning-optimized tier of the voice family.

### Raw benchmarks found

Agent / tool use:

- No verified public score found. No voice-agent tool-use benchmark (no τ-bench, Toolathon, MCP-Atlas or Claw-Eval) is published for this model, and no independent leaderboard covers xAI voice models.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

> **Intentionally omitted.** Grok Voice Think Fast 2.0 yielded **zero** verified public benchmark numbers, so every row would read "no verified public score found". Writing scored placeholder values would fabricate quality evidence for a shipping model, which `RULES.md` forbids. This file stays as `Space_Bunny_Alpha.md.excluded` and is not counted by `pnpm sync`.
>
> Capability mappings a future *measured* report would most plausibly confirm: **Multimodal** sits in the 90–100 band (audio in and audio out) and is the one dimension confirmable from documentation alone; **Context window** cannot be tier-mapped because xAI publishes no figure; **Cost efficiency** is unresolvable from the available data because the only verified Voice API rates are product-level ($0.08/min agent, $15.00/1M chars TTS, $0.10–0.20/hour STT) and none is tied to this model ID. These are spec-derived observations, not evidence, and are deliberately left unscored.

